data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":86,"item_id":"rs_07c04e952bd0a9ae016acbd8670c7087d19aa38ce0df92e6c3","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing concise tests**\n\nI need to focus on implementing just the latest updates, making sure I have enough time to conduct tests without overcomplicating things. Keeping it concise will be essential for efficiency. I’ll aim for clarity in my implementation so it’s straightforward to test later. It’s interesting how simplicity can sometimes lead to better results, and I hope this approach works out well! I should stay organized to track everything efficiently."}

